f and g differ at 1 point, e.g. x=255: 761 vs 762
> equiv g f
g and f differ at 1 point, e.g. x=255: 762 vs 761
> range f
range of f -> u16:
  0..1023   (1024 distinct values)
  fits in u10
  over all 65536 points of the domain
> range g
